WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.425
Entorhinal, live on synthetic fixtures.

00:00:04.625 --> 00:00:10.025
A fixture agent reopens a file it broke. Entorhinal fires a warning snapshot.

00:00:11.225 --> 00:00:15.625
The agent reroutes, citing the evidence. The save is the demo.

00:00:16.825 --> 00:00:21.900
Status, for real: healthy, hash chain verified, action authority zero.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:28.875
Paste a fake key. Pre-egress sanitization redacts it. The test passes.

00:00:30.075 --> 00:00:35.400
The audit log proves zero bytes retained. Zero leaks over hundreds of probes.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:43.625
The builder boundary is absolute: synthetic examples only.  Always.

00:00:44.825 --> 00:00:49.700
The advisor, not the actor.  Inspect the timeline.
